        <ezobject:attribute xmlns:ezremote="http://ez.no/ezobject" ezremote:id="241" ezremote:identifier="body" name="Body" type="ezxmltext">
          <section xmlns:image="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/image/" xmlns:xhtml="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/xhtml/" xmlns:custom="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/custom/">
            <section>
              <section>
                <header>The page is the editor</header>
                <paragraph>With expwt, Exponential's website toolbar, an editor who is signed in sees a slim toolbar on every page: edit this page, add a new page below it, move it, hide it or open it in the administration interface. Changes are drafted, previewed and published without leaving the site.</paragraph>
              </section>
              <section>
                <header>Built for real teams</header>
                <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">
                  <ul>
                    <li>
                      <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">Permissions decide what each editor may change, down to sections and content classes.</paragraph>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">Every change is a new version, with history, comparison and rollback.</paragraph>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <paragraph xmlns:tmp="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/temporary/">Autosave keeps drafts safe while you write.</paragraph>
                    </li>
                  </ul>
                </paragraph>
              </section>
            </section>
          </section>
